for years. goddamn it!

104
00:07:59.333 --> 00:08:03.750
I put the bell up because I thought
it would be fun if someone hit it.

105
00:08:04.083 --> 00:08:08.333
But those little bastards came and started
throwing coins like it was a carnival.

106
00:08:08.583 --> 00:08:11.083
And I had to break my back
all day picking up those coins.

107
00:08:11.333 --> 00:08:13.083
But you know what?
There's no more bell.

108
00:08:13.250 --> 00:08:15.166
So get the hell out of here.

109
00:08:18.416 --> 00:08:19.416
What about you. Jared?

110
00:08:19.583 --> 00:08:20.500
Got anything planned?

111
