the one that brings in the cash.

124
00:08:50.120 --> 00:08:50.583
Sure thing.

125
00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:51.833
Thanks. Roger.

126
00:08:52.083 --> 00:08:52.916
Say hi to my folks.

127
00:08:54.333 --> 00:08:55.166
