She used to laugh at all my jokes.

132
00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:03.500
You want her back?

133
00:09:05.666 --> 00:09:06.250
Stop trying to be cool
and just act like a human being.

134
00:09:13.750 --> 00:09:14.916
