Tie your shoe. I did.
I need braces. They're so long.

141
00:09:37.669 --> 00:09:38.138
Did you get it?

142
00:09:38.338 --> 00:09:39.142
Get what?

143
00:09:40.175 --> 00:09:40.841
I'll meet you at the car.

144
00:09:41.041 --> 00:09:42.651
Are they gonna beat you up?
Oh my God. Go.

145
00:09:43.622 --> 00:09:44.209
Are you smoking?

146
00:09:44.378 --> 00:09:44.930
Let's go.

147
00:09:45.864 --> 00:09:46.580
Bye. Jared.

148
00:10:00.333 --> 00:10:01.416
Any fireworks left?

149
00:10:01.916 --> 00:10:02.583
Just a few.

150
00:10:03.333 --> 00:10:04.333
Cool. bring 'em.
I wanna film them.

151
00:10:05.333 --> 00:10:06.678
That's the ice cream man's song.

152
00:10:06.878 --> 00:10:08.333
Ring-a-ding-dong.
ring-a-ding-dong.

153
00:10:08.583 --> 00:10:10.365
Ring-a-ding-ding. ring-a-ding-dong.

154
00:10:10.565 --> 00:10:13.000
ring-a-ding-dong.
that's the ice cream man's song.

155
00:11:03.250 --> 00:11:03.750
Hey. Hey.

156
